<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95817" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπειρ-άομαι</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπεῖρα</span>) 
			Pass.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be coiled</i>
			or <i>folded round</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέντε ζῶναι ἐσπείρηντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eratosth.
					16.3
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέριξ . . σπειρηθεὶς
			[δράκων</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				457
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δράκοντα . . ἐσπειραμένον περὶ τὸ
					ἀγγεῖον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Paus.
					10.33.9
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχοινίου ἐσπειραμένου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>P.</u>
					1.227
				</span></i>
			: c. dat., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄφεις ἐσπειρημένους τοῖς
				παισίν</span>
			<i>coiled round</i> them, f.l. in Sch.Lyc.<i><span class="en">
				p.5
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i> for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπῃωρημένους</span>.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγος ἐσπειραμένος πρὸς δεινότητα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Demetr.
					<u>Eloc.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
